Third-party components included in this repository:

- Hershey stroke font data (packages/renderer/src/font/): the Hershey fonts
  themselves are in the public domain; the glyph data was obtained from the
  npm package `hersheytext` (MIT, (c) 2014 James T). See ADR-0014 decision 4.

External tools referenced but not included:

- KiCad is a separate project (GPL-3.0-or-later), used only as an external
  tool for manufacturing output and DRC cross-checks. No KiCad source code
  is vendored in this repository. See ADR-0005 and ADR-0014 decision 7.

Third-party documents not included:

- Vendor datasheet PDFs (TI, WCH, 四川索斯特, 硕方精密, ...) are NOT
  distributed with this repository: they are third-party copyrighted
  documents. Obtain them from the manufacturer. The local directory
  examples/reference-project/docs/datasheets/ is git-ignored for that
  reason. See ADR-0015 decision 1 and docs/backlog.md F6.
